Package: BFun
Type: Package
Title: Bayesian Functional Models
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Joseph Sartini
Maintainer: Joseph Sartini <josephsartini@gmail.com>
Description: Supporting functions to fit Bayesian Functional (Mixed) Models 
    using a stable Markov Chain Monte Carlo approach, post-process these results, 
    and assess convergence of sampling. This package provides a transparent,
    publicly available implementation of Functional PCA where the components
    themselves are treated as stochastic. This ensures that all relevant sources 
    of uncertainty are accounted for when performing inference, a necessity in 
    scenarios where the signal-to-noise ratio is small.
